<title>USA: U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.38790.</title>
<headline>U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.38790.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.38790, versus 1.38765 on Tuesday and 1.20635 on July 1, 1974.</p>
<p>Other currency values against the SDR today (July 1, 1974 rates in parentheses) were.</p>
<p> Deutsche Mark     2.43327   (3.06809)</p>
<p> French Franc	8.20124   (5.82126)</p>
<p> Japanese Yen	158.873   (343.773)</p>
<p> Pounds Sterling   0.828844   (0.505474)</p>
<p> Australian Dlr    1.84267   (0.809889)</p>
<p> Aust Schilling    17.1197   (22.0097)</p>
<p> Belgian Franc     50.2767   (45.9249)</p>
<p> Canadian Dlr	1.90586   (1.16295)</p>
<p> Danish Kroner     9.27534   (7.23304)</p>
<p> Indonesian Rupiah 3393.42   (501.291)</p>
<p> Iranian Rial	2431.76   (81.6734)</p>
<p> Italian Lire	2368.88   (779.746)</p>
<p> Kuwait Dinar	0.420020   (0.351685)</p>
<p> Dutch Guilder     2.73944   (3.20316)</p>
<p> Norwegian Kroner  10.1802   (6.59386)</p>
<p> Saudi Arab Riyal  5.19769   (4.25788)</p>
<p> S.A. Rand	   6.28233   (0.80200)</p>
